## ticket_entry_missing
discord: Choose where members open tickets.
plain:   Choose where members open tickets.
model:   [Fixed("Choose where members open tickets.")]

## ticket_queue_missing
discord: Choose a staff channel for new tickets.
plain:   Choose a staff channel for new tickets.
model:   [Fixed("Choose a staff channel for new tickets.")]

## ticket_same_channel
discord: The entry channel and the staff channel must be different.
plain:   The entry channel and the staff channel must be different.
model:   [Fixed("The entry channel and the staff channel must be different.")]

## honeypot_channel_missing
discord: Choose the honeypot channel.
plain:   Choose the honeypot channel.
model:   [Fixed("Choose the honeypot channel.")]

## honeypot_rule_missing
discord: Choose the rule the honeypot applies.
plain:   Choose the rule the honeypot applies.
model:   [Fixed("Choose the rule the honeypot applies.")]

## honeypot_rule_required_fields
discord: The rule **Honeypot** has required case context, which the honeypot can't fill in. Choose another rule or make those fields optional on the dashboard.
plain:   The rule Honeypot has required case context, which the honeypot can't fill in. Choose another rule or make those fields optional on the dashboard.
model:   [Fixed("The rule "), Bold([User("Honeypot")]), Fixed(" has required case context, which the honeypot can't fill in. Choose another rule or make those fields optional on the dashboard.")]

## activity_no_route
discord: Choose a channel for server activity.
plain:   Choose a channel for server activity.
model:   [Fixed("Choose a channel for server activity.")]

## activity_needs_audit_log
discord: In Server Settings → Roles, give Quack's role View Audit Log. Quack uses it to show who banned or unbanned a member.
plain:   In Server Settings → Roles, give Quack's role View Audit Log. Quack uses it to show who banned or unbanned a member.
model:   [Fixed("In Server Settings → Roles, give Quack's role View Audit Log. Quack uses it to show who banned or unbanned a member.")]

## channel_permissions
discord: In <#444> → Edit Channel → Permissions, allow Manage Messages and Read Message History for Quack.
plain:   In #staff → Edit Channel → Permissions, allow Manage Messages and Read Message History for Quack.
model:   [Fixed("In "), Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("staff") }), Fixed(" → Edit Channel → Permissions, allow Manage Messages and Read Message History for Quack.")]

## channel_not_staff_only
discord: <#444> can be viewed by members outside staff. Fix its View Channel permissions or choose another channel.
plain:   #staff can be viewed by members outside staff. Fix its View Channel permissions or choose another channel.
model:   [Channel(ChannelRef { id: ChannelId(444), name: Some("staff") }), Fixed(" can be viewed by members outside staff. Fix its View Channel permissions or choose another channel.")]

